@kamilsk, I think what you thought was working, is the same behaviour that my local build also works.
Seems like the change didn't solve the problem. Guess we can revert https://github.com/goreleaser/goreleaser/pull/226.
I guess it is difficult to simulate the environment that's being used by Travis CI since, as @kamilsk demonstrated, building on another linux also worked without issues.
